-- Bilingual bridge (s52), ASCII twin: English column names scripted in English. The JA conjugate says the same thing through the registry's ja aliases — different surface spellings, one emitted program. (was s52-bilingual-bridge)
-- Scouts short on supplies lose heart, in either language: the ja alias table is the bridge, and --emit proves both crossings land on the same bytes.
--! registry ../registries/097-bilingual-bridge.reg
--! expect morale = 40 50 50 40 50

Scout & Supplies < 20 , Morale -= 10
